{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36833","headline":"春日投钱塘元帅尚父二首 一 · 罗隐","name":"春日投钱塘元帅尚父二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正忧衰老辱金台，敢望昭王顾问来。\n门外旌旗屯[虎豹]，壁闲章句动风雷。\n三都节已联翩降，两地花应次第开。\n若比紫髯分鼎足，未闻余力有琼环。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}